{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20281","headline":"楚妃叹 · 张籍","name":"楚妃叹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湘云初起江沉沉，君王遥在云梦林。\n江南雨多旌旗暗，台下朝朝春水深。\n章华殿前朝万国，君心独自无终极。\n楚兵满地能逐禽，谁用一身骋筋力。\n西江若飜云梦中，麋鹿死尽应还宫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20281.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20281","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}